cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the two papers rather than this repository. Both are listed under
  preferred-citation and references below.
title: >-
  Assurance Gaps in an Integrated Safety and Cybersecurity Case for an
  AI-Based Perception Component in Highly Automated Driving
abstract: >-
  Supplementary material for two SAFECOMP 2026 papers. Builds the single GSN
  argument that ISO 26262, ISO 21448, ISO/SAE 21434 and ISO/PAS 8800 jointly
  imply for an AI-based perception component, and reports the decision points
  and findings the combination exposes.
